It fires a beam of helium atoms

291
00:10:46,316 --> 00:10:47,730
through the pattern.

292
00:10:47,900 --> 00:10:50,103
It says the atoms offer a precision

293
00:10:50,103 --> 00:10:52,085
of a tenth of a nanometer,

294
00:10:52,085 --> 00:10:54,087
and it aims to have machines ready

295
00:10:54,087 --> 00:10:56,290
to sell by twenty twenty-nine or twenty

296
00:10:56,290 --> 00:10:57,290
thirty.

297
00:10:57,310 --> 00:10:58,109
Again,

298
00:10:58,109 --> 00:10:59,260
a goal.

299
00:10:59,400 --> 00:11:00,428
Meanwhile,

300
00:11:00,428 --> 00:11:02,490
ASML is not standing still.

301
00:11:02,490 --> 00:11:05,027
Its high-NA machines are already shipping

302
00:11:05,027 --> 00:11:06,472
to factories.

303
00:11:06,717 --> 00:11:10,367
So could a stamp break ASML's monopoly?

304
00:11:10,367 --> 00:11:11,677
Not soon.

305
00:11:11,747 --> 00:11:13,048
Canon's machine works,

306
00:11:13,048 --> 00:11:14,591
but for now it is a tool

307
00:11:14,591 --> 00:11:16,135
for the chips that do not need

308
00:11:16,135 --> 00:11:17,557
the very best.

309
00:11:17,557 --> 00:11:19,713
China's prototype makes light,

310
00:11:19,713 --> 00:11:20,797
not chips.

311
00:11:20,817 --> 00:11:22,343
The startups have goals,

312
00:11:22,343 --> 00:11:23,857
not factories.

313
00:11:23,857 --> 00:11:25,897
And that is the real lesson.

314
00:11:25,897 --> 00:11:29,217
ASML's monopoly was never just a machine.

315
00:11:29,267 --> 00:11:31,117
It was a bet held for sixteen

316
00:11:31,117 --> 00:11:31,557
years,

317
00:11:31,557 --> 00:11:34,007
while everyone else gave up.

318
00:11:34,077 --> 00:11:36,457
Breaking it will take the same thing.

319
00:11:36,457 --> 00:11:37,958
Not a cheaper trick,

320
00:11:37,958 --> 00:11:40,503
but years of patience nobody else has

321
00:11:40,503 --> 00:11:41,612
yet shown.

322
00:11:41,850 --> 00:11:44,310
Next time on The Hidden Economics,

323
00:11:44,310 --> 00:11:47,244
we follow the money behind another hidden

324
00:11:47,244 --> 00:11:49,650
link of the world economy.

325
00:11:49,770 --> 00:11:51,911
This is The Hidden Economics.
